 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "74c2f59c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 02 — Spatiotemporal Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook aggregates cleaned AIS observations by **GFW spatial cell × month × year** and establishes the temporal/spatial summaries needed before regional trend analysis."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "241def27",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Important preprocessing note\n",
    "\n",
    "The source dataset used for this analysis was previously filtered to retain observations with fishing activity. Therefore, the current dataset represents fishing-active observations rather than all vessel presence/effort observations.\n",
    "\n",
    "Consequently, `fishing_hours` is the primary measure of fishing effort. `fishing_ratio` is supplementary and should not be interpreted as the proportion of all vessel time spent fishing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6af942a8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1. Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c0a788bd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", None)\n",
    "pd.set_option(\"display.max_rows\", 100)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7960bde3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2. Load cleaned dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "2f6b298d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Shape: (730488, 11)\n",
      "Date range: 2012-02-15 00:00:00 → 2024-12-31 00:00:00\n",
      "Unique vessels: 1930\n",
      "Unique spatial cells: 23846\n",
      "Latitude: -29.2 → 40.0\n",
      "Longitude: 32.0 → 161.9\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "DATA_FILE = Path(\"../outputs/processed/ais_cleaned.parquet\")\n",
    "ais = pd.read_parquet(DATA_FILE)\n",
    "print(\"Shape:\", ais.shape)\n",
    "print(\"Date range:\", ais.date.min(), \"→\", ais.date.max())\n",
    "print(\"Unique vessels:\", ais.mmsi.nunique())\n",
    "print(\"Unique spatial cells:\", ais[[\"cell_ll_lat\",\"cell_ll_lon\"]].drop_duplicates().shape[0])\n",
    "print(\"Latitude:\", ais.cell_ll_lat.min(), \"→\", ais.cell_ll_lat.max())\n",
    "print(\"Longitude:\", ais.cell_ll_lon.min(), \"→\", ais.cell_ll_lon.max())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95ba5269",
   "metadata": {},
